{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1789792372742,"sessionID":"ses_f4810bfebffeApNO7X3dNhAmLI","part":{"id":"prt_0b7f04803001HEgJRhu1jIX02Y","messageID":"msg_0b7f0424a001fF4NPKjCIrMd1j","sessionID":"ses_f4810bfebffeApNO7X3dNhAmLI","snapshot":"7987521a496c1c846c531abcc7a3ed1d4d93a146","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1789792375340,"sessionID":"ses_f4810bfebffeApNO7X3dNhAmLI","part":{"id":"prt_0b7f04cf10011VckARvKIpiwy9","messageID":"msg_0b7f0424a001fF4NPKjCIrMd1j","sessionID":"ses_f4810bfebffeApNO7X3dNhAmLI","type":"text","text":"The regression comes from three Lua checks that test whether a lock exists without comparing its token. I’ve restored token comparisons. I also moved immediate retry’s delayed-job promotion after ownership validation, so a rejected stale retry cannot alter the queue or emit events.\n","time":{"start":1789792374001,"end":1789792375337},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0f95a660458e1f34016aae1075f88087d18c3024bc8ea22696","phase":"commentary"}}}}
